@Sellora.CoreService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5235

GET {{Sellora.CoreService.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Identity & scope: where does the caller sit?
GET {{Sellora.CoreService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/scope
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a staff member (Company Admin: any staff role; Agency Operator: SalesRep)
POST {{Sellora.CoreService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "SalesRep",
  "displayName": "Nimal Perera",
  "email": "nimal.perera@example.lk",
  "phone": "0771234567"
}
